      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat sesame oil in a skillet over medium heat. Add brussels sprouts and cook for 5 minutes. Transfer to a bowl and mix with soy sauce and fish sauce.",
